{"text": "Eckels walked into the office of Time Travel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The big sign on the wall said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> NAME ANY YEAR IN THE PAST. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> WE TAKE YOU THERE. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a TV on the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And Mister Keith, the new president. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was on the news. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How can we help you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Mister Parker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The founder of Time Travel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have always wanted to see a dinosaur. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is it possible. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Asked Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sure, said Mister Parker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We can take you back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To the jungle of 60 million years ago. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Great, said Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Can you take me there now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You are lucky. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is a time machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That leaves in 10 minutes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Mister Parker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This is Travis. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Your travel guide. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He continued. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To stay safe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You must follow his instructions.", "alignment": {"characters": ["E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "f", "f", "i", "c", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "T", "i", "m", "e", " ", "T", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "s", "i", "g", "n", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "A", "M", "E", " ", "A", "N", "Y", " ", "Y", "E", "A", "R",